WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:03.727
The shark swam toward Ringo.

2
00:00:03.728 --> 00:00:06.390
"Oh no!" Ringo thought.

3
00:00:06.391 --> 00:00:08.989
"I have to hide!"

4
00:00:08.990 --> 00:00:13.010
He saw a big rock behind some seaweed.

5
00:00:13.011 --> 00:00:15.157
Ringo darted behind the rock.

6
00:00:15.158 --> 00:00:18.434
The shark swam away.

7
00:00:18.435 --> 00:00:21.720
"Whew!" Ringo said.

8
00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:29.026
Ringo swam to the machine.

9
00:00:29.027 --> 00:00:32.384
He took out the old battery.

10
00:00:32.385 --> 00:00:40.758
Then he put in the new one.

11
00:00:40.759 --> 00:00:43.933
"I did it!" Ringo thought.

12
00:00:43.934 --> 00:00:48.589
Ooga! Ooga! An alarm went off!

13
00:00:48.590 --> 00:00:54.407
Ringo groaned. "We'll start growing soon!

14
00:00:54.408 --> 00:01:01.207
I have to return to the clam!"

15
00:01:01.208 --> 00:01:04.581
Ringo swam as fast as he could.

16
00:01:04.582 --> 00:01:09.406
But something big was behind him.

17
00:01:09.407 --> 00:01:15.966
The shark was following him!

18
00:01:15.967 --> 00:01:22.422
Ringo swam faster.

19
00:01:22.423 --> 00:01:25.778
Suddenly the shark spotted a fish.

20
00:01:25.779 --> 00:01:35.700
It turned to chase it!

21
00:01:35.701 --> 00:01:40.664
Ringo finally made it back to the clam.

22
00:01:40.665 --> 00:01:45.513
Lucy and the robots were still inside.

23
00:01:45.514 --> 00:01:49.944
"Are you all okay?" Ringo yelled.

24
00:01:49.945 --> 00:01:56.072
"We still can't get out!" Lucy cried.

25
00:01:56.073 --> 00:01:59.982
"And the shrinking is wearing off!"

26
00:01:59.983 --> 00:02:03.158
"I'll get you out," Ringo yelled.

27
00:02:03.159 --> 00:02:06.468
He banged and kicked on the shell.

28
00:02:06.469 --> 00:02:08.805
Nothing worked.

29
00:02:08.806 --> 00:02:13.972
"I just saved Micro Planet," Ringo thought.

30
00:02:13.973 --> 00:02:16.984
"But now we're getting bigger.

31
00:02:16.985 --> 00:02:20.946
We're going to crush the planet!"

